WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:08.983
For too long, a handful of gatekeepers decided which stories got made.

2
00:00:09.303 --> 00:00:12.051
GreenlitX puts that choice in the hands of the audience.

3
00:00:12.371 --> 00:00:14.950
Discover films to watch and projects seeking support.

4
00:00:15.270 --> 00:00:21.866
Filmmakers can bring AI, hybrid, and traditional productions to one platform, share their vision, and build an audience around it.

5
00:00:22.186 --> 00:00:25.864
If a project reaches its funding goal and is Greenlit, your pledge goes through.

6
00:00:26.184 --> 00:00:27.681
If it doesn't, you pay nothing.

7
00:00:28.001 --> 00:00:29.139
GreenlitX.

8
00:00:29.389 --> 00:00:31.237
Hollywood decides what gets made today.

9
00:00:31.557 --> 00:00:33.670
On GreenlitX, the audience does.
